Work that only you do. We find the first thing to move.</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl bg-sheet p-4"><img src="/business-growth-blueprint-2/media/icons/sales.gif" alt="" class="size-12 rounded-xl"/><p class="mt-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-mute">03<!-- --> · <!-- -->Sales</p><h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold">Push vs a system</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-mute">Why sales stop when you stop pushing.</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl bg-sheet p-4"><img src="/business-growth-blueprint-2/media/icons/order.gif" alt="" class="size-12 rounded-xl"/><p class="mt-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-mute">04<!-- --> · <!-- -->90 days</p><h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold">What to do first</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-mute">Two or three things, in order. Not a notebook of ideas.</p></li></ol></section><section class="px-5 py-10 md:py-14"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-mute uppercase">Who should come</p><h2 class="font-serif mt-2 max-w-xl text-4xl font-medium md:text-5xl">The room is small on purpose.</h2><div class="mt-10 grid overflow-hidden rounded-3xl md:grid-cols-2"><div class="bg-sheet p-6 md:p-10"><h3 class="font-serif text-3xl font-medium">Come if</h3><ul class="mt-6 grid gap-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-bone px-4 py-3"><span class="mt-0.5 grid size-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-signal text-signal-ink"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span>The business is 2+ years old and growth has stopped</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-bone px-4 py-3"><span class="mt-0.5 grid size-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-signal text-signal-ink"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg